#### stdlib_base_float32_is_same_value (src/main.c:41)

```c
bool stdlib_base_float32_is_same_value( const float a, const float b ) {
	if ( a == b ) {
		if ( a == 0.0f ) {
			return 1.0f / a == 1.0f / b; // handles +-0
		}
		return true;
	}
	return ( a != a && b != b ); // handles NaNs
}
```

